{"group":{"id":3,"text":"这里是《欧拉好猫新手课堂》第十三期。今天我们学习了车机主页、桌面风格、小组件、状态栏、快捷栏、控制中心、车辆设置、全应用界面、显示设置和手机连接入口。先熟悉这些基础路径，之后学习导航、娱乐和车辆功能时，就不会因为找不到菜单而手忙脚乱。\n\n下一期，我们将进一步学习车机导航和手机互联的日常使用，包括目的地搜索、常用地址、充电站搜索、路线偏好，以及手机连接时需要注意的事项。仍然以官方说明书和你的实际车辆为准。\n\n祝你每一次出行都平安、顺利。我们下一期见。","firstParagraph":55,"lastParagraph":57},"voiceId":"4270665fc47f44aa989c093bb3dc2b99","settings":{"sampleRate":24000,"channels":1,"encoding":"pcm","speed":1},"speech":{"audio_url":"https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/07be00049e5e437caded0df6e5241658/4270665fc47f44aa989c093bb3dc2b99/id=49b38578a4324389ac9cf694d690bc3a.pcm","duration":44.17222222222222,"original_characters":[{"text":"这","start_time":0.256,"end_time":0.512},{"text":"里","start_time":0.512,"end_time":0.597},{"text":"是","start_time":0.597,"end_time":0.725},{"text":"《","start_time":0.725,"end_time":0.768},{"text":"欧","start_time":0.768,"end_time":0.896},{"text":"拉","start_time":0.896,"end_time":1.067},{"text":"好","start_time":1.067,"end_time":1.237},{"text":"猫","start_time":1.237,"end_time":1.408},{"text":"新","start_time":1.408,"end_time":1.579},{"text":"手","start_time":1.579,"end_time":1.707},{"text":"课","start_time":1.707,"end_time":1.877},{"text":"堂","start_time":1.877,"end_time":2.048},{"text":"》","start_time":2.048,"end_time":2.091},{"text":"第","start_time":2.091,"end_time":2.176},{"text":"十","start_time":2.176,"end_time":2.347},{"text":"三","start_time":2.347,"end_time":2.56},{"text":"期","start_time":2.56,"end_time":2.816},{"text":"。","start_time":2.816,"end_time":3.328},{"text":"今","start_time":3.328,"end_time":3.499},{"text":"天","start_time":3.499,"end_time":3.627},{"text":"我","start_time":3.627,"end_time":3.712},{"text":"们","start_time":3.712,"end_time":3.797},{"text":"学","start_time":3.797,"end_time":3.968},{"text":"习","start_time":3.968,"end_time":4.096},{"text":"了","start_time":4.096,"end_time":4.224},{"text":"车","start_time":4.224,"end_time":4.437},{"text":"机","start_time":4.437,"end_time":4.565},{"text":"主","start_time":4.565,"end_time